  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP: Strengthening Ethiopia&#x2019;s Elections for Democratic Sustainability (SEEDS2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen electoral systems and processes in Ethiopia that promote inclusion, gender equality, transparency and accountability through an effective and sustainable electoral management body and other electoral stakeholders. This will be done through strengthening the institutional, operational and human resource capacities of NEBE at national and sub-national levels to deliver credible elections, promoting inclusion throughout the electoral process, and contributing to the enhancement of the overall electoral environment, including areas of the policy and legal frameworks and civic engagement. It also aims to support the contributions of other stakeholders including national institutions, non-state entities and civil society at national and regional level, and enhance electoral integrity and inclusion, particularly the increased participation of women and other under- represented groups to support the strengthening of Ethiopia&apos;s democratic consolidation.</narrative>
  </description>
